{"3337640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Gang", "steam_appid": 3337640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be a gambling cut-throat rogue, a righteous monk, or a spellcrafting mage? Dungeon Gang is a multiplayer RPG where you can do this and more with up to 12 players. Includes a custom dungeon creator.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character and put together a Dungeon Gang with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different character classes - play as a Warrior, Rogue, Monk, Soldier, Ranger, Sorcerer, or Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land of Zabasba and face the foes within its dungeons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast a wide range of spells and design your own spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read in-game books to increase your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with several types of weapons or just use your fists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haggle with merchants &amp; flip coins for gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puff on pipes and relax with Halflings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom dungeons with deadly traps, interactive objects, and a wide range of monsters</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to be a gambling cut-throat rogue, a righteous monk, or a spellcrafting mage? Dungeon Gang is a multiplayer RPG where you can do this and more with up to 12 players. Includes a custom dungeon creator.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a character and put together a Dungeon Gang with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore different character classes - play as a Warrior, Rogue, Monk, Soldier, Ranger, Sorcerer, or Mage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the land of Zabasba and face the foes within its dungeons</p></l